WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:00.660
Thank you.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.860
When you're not real

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:11.860
You're consumed with how much you get

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:16.310
You waste your time with hate and regret

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:22.190
You're broken when it's not over

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:18.810
Supporting the blame should know I suffer the same.

